            "description": "资源池相关的查询参数,用平铺的json字符串表示。例如 [{\"resourcePoolId\":\"resourcepoolId1\",\"azIdList\":[\"azId1\",\"azId2\"]}]",
            "in": "query",
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "maxLength": 2048,
            "minLength": 0
          },
          {
